{
 "cells": [
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "# Minimal ingredients for $[3,1,0]^{\\otimes 2}$: clean CG functionals from $\\Omega$ and the site-1 $T$'s\n\nThis is the rep-generic version of `Minimal-ingredients-EH.wb` (which is $[2,1,0]^2$). The default is $\\Lambda=[3,1,0]$ (dim 15, 225 states). Setting $\\Lambda=\\{2,1,0\\}$ in the first code cell runs the control. Self-contained; the first code cell clears the (shared) kernel. Matrices are sparse, numeric at precision `pr`.\n\n**Site-1 localizing data** (`L2-310-localization.md`; the $f_\\lambda$ were fitted at P1 there and are re-checked in Section 4): at $u=\\theta_1-3h$, $T_{(1,1)},T_{(2,2)},T_{(3,2)}$ with\n$f_{(1,1)}=(\\theta_{12}-2h)(\\theta_{12}-4h)$, $f_{(2,2)}=(\\theta_{12}-h)(\\theta_{12}-2h)(\\theta_{12}-3h)(\\theta_{12}-4h)$, $f_{(3,2)}=(\\theta_{12}-h)^2(\\theta_{12}-2h)(\\theta_{12}-3h)(\\theta_{12}-4h)$.\n\n**Question.** Do the bare row $\\langle\\Omega|\\Psi\\rangle$ and these three site-1 rows alone (no site-2 $t$'s) give clean leading-order functionals for all 10 HW states, with rank equal to the multiplicity on $[5,2,1]$ and $[4,3,1]$?\n\n**The Q side** is $T_\\lambda^B\\langle\\Omega|\\Psi_B\\rangle/f_\\lambda$, computed from the eigenvector (`QB`), as in the $[2,1,0]$ notebook. Conventions as there: $\\mathcal L_{ij}=(u-\\theta_s)\\delta_{ij}+hE_{ij}$, twist on the right, EH generators. CBR fusion $T_\\lambda(u)=\\det_{i,j}t_{\\lambda'_j+i-j}(u+(i-1)h)$ with $t_0=1$.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* fresh kernel: clears Global` for every notebook sharing this kernel (their files are untouched) *)\nClearAll @@ Select[Names[\"Global`*\"], FreeQ[Attributes[#], Protected] &];\n(* GT basis and gl(3) generators, verbatim from the clean L=1 notebook *)\nps[rep_] := ps[rep] = Block[{res = (Prepend[rep, #1] &) /@ Tuples[Table[Range[rep[[1, i + 1]], rep[[1, i]]], {i, 1, Length[rep[[1]]] - 1}]]}, If[Length[res[[1, 1]]] == 1, Reverse[Sort[res]], Reverse[Sort[Flatten[ps /@ res, 1]]]]];\ndim[rep_] := dim[rep] = Length[ps[{rep}]];\nJ0[k_][pat_] := J0[k][pat] = Sum[pat[[k, i]], {i, 1, k}] - Sum[pat[[k - 1, i]], {i, 1, k - 1}];\nJp[k_][pat_] := Jp[k][pat] = -Sum[(Product[pat[[k, i]] - i - pat[[k + 1, j]] + j, {j, Range[k + 1]}]/Product[pat[[k, i]] - i - pat[[k, j]] + j, {j, Complement[Range[k], {i}]}])*v[ReplacePart[pat, {k, i} -> pat[[k, i]] + 1]], {i, 1, k}];\nJm[k_][pat_] := Jm[k][pat] = Sum[(Product[pat[[k, i]] - i - pat[[k - 1, j]] + j, {j, Range[k - 1]}]/Product[pat[[k, i]] - i - pat[[k, j]] + j, {j, Complement[Range[k], {i}]}])*v[ReplacePart[pat, {k, i} -> pat[[k, i]] - 1]], {i, 1, k}];\nJJ[k_, l_, rep_] := JJ[k, l, rep] = Which[\n  k == l, DiagonalMatrix[J0[k] /@ ps[{rep}]],\n  l == k + 1, Transpose[Table[(Coefficient[Jp[k][ps[{rep}][[i]]], v[#1]] &) /@ ps[{rep}], {i, 1, Length[ps[{rep}]]}]],\n  l == k - 1, Transpose[Table[(Coefficient[Jm[l][ps[{rep}][[i]]], v[#1]] &) /@ ps[{rep}], {i, 1, Length[ps[{rep}]]}]],\n  l > k + 1, JJ[k, k + 1, rep] . JJ[k + 1, l, rep] - JJ[k + 1, l, rep] . JJ[k, k + 1, rep],\n  l < k - 1, JJ[k, k - 1, rep] . JJ[k - 1, l, rep] - JJ[k - 1, l, rep] . JJ[k, k - 1, rep]];\n(* ---- the rep; switch to {2, 1, 0} for the control ---- *)\nΛ = {3, 1, 0};\n(* site-1 localizing data: {shift c (u = θ1 + c h), CBR shapes, f_λ}; delayed so a change of chain point updates the f's *)\nlocSpec[{2, 1, 0}] := {-2, {{1, 1}, {2, 1}}, {(θ12 - hN) (θ12 - 3 hN), (θ12 - hN)^2 (θ12 - 3 hN)}};\nlocSpec[{3, 1, 0}] := {-3, {{1, 1}, {2, 2}, {3, 2}}, {(θ12 - 2 hN) (θ12 - 4 hN), (θ12 - hN) (θ12 - 2 hN) (θ12 - 3 hN) (θ12 - 4 hN), (θ12 - hN)^2 (θ12 - 2 hN) (θ12 - 3 hN) (θ12 - 4 hN)}};\nlocShapes := locSpec[Λ][[2]]; fOf[λ_] := locSpec[Λ][[3, Position[locShapes, λ][[1, 1]]]]; uLoc := thN[[1]] + locSpec[Λ][[1]] hN;\nd1 = dim[Λ]; d2 = d1^2; id1 = IdentityMatrix[d1]; idm2 = IdentityMatrix[d2, SparseArray]; pr = 120;\nhN = 1/2; thN = {2/7, -3/5}; θ12 = thN[[1]] - thN[[2]];\n(* Hermitian generators EH = Rd.E.Rd^-1 with EH^T = EH_ji; Rd is diagonal, unrelated to the rotation R *)\nMsolEH = Module[{Mv = Array[mm, d1]}, Mv /. First[Solve[Join[Thread[DeleteCases[Union[Flatten[Table[DiagonalMatrix[Mv] . JJ[j, i, Λ] - Transpose[JJ[i, j, Λ]] . DiagonalMatrix[Mv], {i, 3}, {j, 3}]]], 0] == 0], {mm[1] == 1}], Mv]]];\nRd = Sqrt[MsolEH];\nEe[i_, j_] := Ee[i, j] = DiagonalMatrix[Rd] . JJ[i, j, Λ] . DiagonalMatrix[1/Rd];\nEN[i_, j_] := EN[i, j] = N[Ee[i, j], pr];\nEtotN[i_, j_] := EtotN[i, j] = KroneckerProduct[SparseArray[EN[i, j]], SparseArray[id1]] + KroneckerProduct[SparseArray[id1], SparseArray[EN[i, j]]];\nzeroQ[e_] := AllTrue[Union[Flatten[{e}]], PossibleZeroQ];\nwtBasis = Flatten[Table[Table[J0[k][p1] + J0[k][p2], {k, 3}], {p1, ps[{Λ}]}, {p2, ps[{Λ}]}], 1];\nsecOf[μ_] := secOf[μ] = Flatten[Position[wtBasis, μ]];\nkron[a_, b_] := Flatten[KroneckerProduct[a, b]];\ne1 = UnitVector[d1, 1];\n(* exp of a nilpotent matrix: finite sum from the identity (MatrixPower[nilpotent, 0] errors) *)\nnexp[A_] := id1 + Sum[MatrixPower[A, k]/k!, {k, 1, 2 (Λ[[1]] - Λ[[3]])}];\nGrid[{{\"Λ\", Λ}, {\"one-site, two-site dimension\", {d1, d2}}, {\"Rd\", Rd}, {\"EH^T = EH_ji\", And @@ Flatten[Table[zeroQ[Transpose[Ee[i, j]] - Ee[j, i]], {i, 3}, {j, 3}]]}, {\"site-1 shapes at θ1 + c h\", locSpec[Λ][[1 ;; 2]]}}, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"942214\" data-output-id=\"53\" data-out-n=\"580\" data-sub-idx=\"30\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"1\" data-sub-start=\"35\" data-sub-end=\"35\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[580]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"26\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:8.5073em;vertical-align:-3.9836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:4.5236em;\"><span style=\"top:-6.4836em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:6.4836em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:8.4673em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-3.9836em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:4.4836em;\"><span style=\"top:-7.6937em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.05em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Λ</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.4936em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.05em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">one-site, two-site dimension</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-5.2264em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.05em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Rd</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.0264em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.05em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">EH</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˆ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">T = EH_ji</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.6164em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.05em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">site-1 shapes at </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.02778em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mord\">1 + c h</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.9836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:8.4673em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-3.9836em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:4.4836em;\"><span style=\"top:-7.6937em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.05em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.4936em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.05em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">15</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">225</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-5.2264em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.05em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">{</span></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9072em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:0.833em;\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.8672em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:0.853em;height:1.08em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.08em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1080\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M95,702\nc-2.7,0,-7.17,-2.7,-13.5,-8c-5.8,-5.3,-9.5,-10,-9.5,-14\nc0,-2,0.3,-3.3,1,-4c1.3,-2.7,23.83,-20.7,67.5,-54\nc44.2,-33.3,65.8,-50.3,66.5,-51c1.3,-1.3,3,-2,5,-2c4.7,0,8.7,3.3,12,10\ns173,378,173,378c0.7,0,35.3,-71,104,-213c68.7,-142,137.5,-285,206.5,-429\nc69,-144,104.5,-217.7,106.5,-221\nl0 -0\nc5.3,-9.3,12,-14,20,-14\nH400000v40H845.2724\ns-225.272,467,-225.272,467s-235,486,-235,486c-2.7,4.7,-9,7,-19,7\nc-6,0,-10,-1,-12,-3s-194,-422,-194,-4