  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 4. Site-1 localization at $\\theta_1+ch$\n$\\langle\\Omega|T_\\lambda(\\theta_1+ch)=f_\\lambda\\,\\langle v_\\lambda|\\otimes\\langle\\Omega_{zw}|$ with $\\langle v_\\lambda|=\\langle\\Omega_{zw}|T_\\lambda^{L=1,\\theta_1}(\\theta_1+ch)$. Relative residuals at the finite test twist and at small $\\varepsilon$; this also re-checks the fitted $f_\\lambda$.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "vλ[λ_, zv_, wv_] := Om1[zv, wv] . TL1[1, λ, uLoc, DiagonalMatrix[zv]];\nrelRes[a_, b_] := maxAbs[a - b]/maxAbs[b];\nlocTest[zv_, wv_] := Table[relRes[Om2[zv, wv] . TL2[λ, uLoc, DiagonalMatrix[zv]], fOf[λ] kron[vλ[λ, zv, wv], Om1[zv, wv]]], {λ, locShapes}];\n{tL, locRows} = AbsoluteTiming[{Prepend[locTest[zT, wT], \"finite test twist\"], Prepend[locTest[zOf[εs[[1]]], wOf[εs[[1]]]], \"ε = 10^-3\"]}];\nGrid[Join[{Prepend[(\"T_\" <> ToString[#] &) /@ locShapes, \"twist\"]}, locRows, {{\"time (s)\", tL}}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"942214\" data-output-id=\"57\" data-out-n=\"628\" data-sub-idx=\"4\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"9\" data-sub-start=\"4\" data-sub-end=\"4\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[628]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"26\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:4.84em;vertical-align:-2.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.69em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.65em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.65em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:4.8em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-2.15em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.65em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">twist</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">finite test twist</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span><span class=\"mord\"> = 10</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"v