   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 5. The chain, the signal/contamination split, and killing the top weight\nBasis covectors, in the frame with $R$ undone: $c_0=e_1\\otimes e_1$ (the bare row: $\\langle\\Omega|=c_0(R\\otimes R)$) and $c_\\lambda=\\langle v_\\lambda|R^{-1}\\otimes e_1^T$ for each localizing shape. Their Q-side numbers are `QB` $=\\{\\langle\\Omega|\\Psi\\rangle,\\ T^B_\\lambda\\langle\\Omega|\\Psi\\rangle/f_\\lambda\\}$. For each, signal $S=c\\cdot P_{\\rm HW}\\Psi$, contamination $K=c\\cdot(R\\otimes R)\\Psi_\\perp$, and $\\kappa=(S+K)/S$.\n\n**The top weight is removed exactly.** For $\\mu\\neq2\\Lambda$, $e_1e_1\\cdot P_{\\rm HW}\\Psi=0$, so $\\langle\\Omega|\\Psi\\rangle=e_1e_1\\cdot(R\\otimes R)\\Psi_\\perp$: the bare overlap *is* the top-weight component of $(R\\otimes R)\\Psi_\\perp$. The top-weight contamination of $c_\\lambda$ is therefore $(c_\\lambda\\cdot e_1e_1)\\langle\\Omega|\\Psi\\rangle$, and $d_\\lambda=c_\\lambda-(c_\\lambda\\cdot e_1e_1)\\,c_0$ removes it identically, at any $\\varepsilon$ and for any rep. The table gives $\\kappa$ for each raw $c_\\lambda$ and each top-killed $d_\\lambda$.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "cλ[λ_, zv_, wv_] := kron[vλ[λ, zv, wv] . RrotInv[zv, wv], e1];\nnB := 1 + Length[locShapes];\nKS[μ_, copy_, ε_, φv_, ωv_] := Module[{zv = N[Exp[ε φv], pr], wv = N[Exp[ε ωv], pr], Ψ, Ψhw, rest, cs, k},\n   Ψ = pickState[μ, copy, zv][\"psi\"]; Ψhw = projHW[μ, Ψ]; rest = RR[zv, wv] . (Ψ - Ψhw); k = Ordering[Abs[Ψ], -1][[1]];\n   cs = Prepend[cλ[#, zv, wv] & /@ locShapes, kron[e1, e1]];\n   <|\"S\" -> (# . Ψhw & /@ cs), \"K\" -> (# . rest & /@ cs), \"top\" -> (# . kron[e1, e1] & /@ cs), \"sc\" -> Norm[Ψ] Max[Norm /@ cs], \"cs\" -> cs, \"z\" -> zv, \"w\" -> wv,\n    \"Q\" -> Prepend[Table[((TL2[λ, uLoc, DiagonalMatrix[zv]] . Ψ)[[k]]/Ψ[[k]]) (Om2[zv, wv] . Ψ)/fOf[λ], {λ, locShapes}], Om2[zv, wv] . Ψ],\n    \"OmPsi\" -> Om2[zv, wv] . Ψ, \"topRest\" -> kron[e1, e1] . rest, \"normPsi\" -> Norm[Ψ], \"psi\" -> Ψ, \"rest\" -> rest|>];\nKSm[μ_, copy_, ε_] := KSm[μ, copy, ε] = KS[μ, copy, ε, φ, ω];\n(* v = coefficients on the basis {c0, c_λ...}; topKill[j] = d_λ for the j-th shape *)\ntopKill[j_, d_] := ReplacePart[UnitVector[nB, j + 1], 1 -> -d[\"top\"][[j + 1]]];\nκv[v_, d_] := With[{s = v . d[\"S\"], q = v . (d[\"S\"] + d[\"K\"])}, Which[Abs[q] < 10^-50 d[\"sc\"], \"0 = 0\", Abs[s] < 10^-50 d[\"sc\"], \"CG = 0\", True, N[q/s, 6]]];\n{tK, kTab} = AbsoluteTiming[Table[With[{A = KSm[μc[[1]], μc[[2]], εs[[1]]], B = KSm[μc[[1]], μc[[2]], εs[[2]]]},\n     Join[{μc[[1]], μc[[2]]}, Flatten[Table[{κv[UnitVector[nB, j + 1], B], κv[topKill[j, A], A], κv[topKill[j, B], B]}, {j, Length[locShapes]}]]]], {μc, hwList}]];\n(* exact checks: chain identity c·(R⊗R)Ψ = Q side; <Ω|Ψ> = top component of (R⊗R)Ψ⊥ (non-top weights) *)\nchainRes = Max[Table[With[{d = KSm[μc[[1]], μc[[2]], εs[[1]]]}, Max[Abs[d[\"Q\"] - (d[\"S\"] + d[\"K\"])]]/d[\"sc\"]], {μc, hwList}]];\ntopRes = Max[Table[With[{d = KSm[μc[[1]], μc[[2]], εs[[1]]]}, Abs[d[\"OmPsi\"] - d[\"topRest\"]]/Abs[d[\"OmPsi\"]]], {μc, Rest[hwList]}]];\nGrid[Join[{Join[{\"μ\", \"copy\"}, Flatten[Table[{\"κ raw c\" <> ToString[λ] <> \" (ε=10^-4)\", \"κ top-killed d\" <> ToString[λ] <> \" (10^-3)\", \"(10^-4)\"}, {λ, locShapes}]]]}, kTab,\n   {{\"chain residual\", chainRes}, {\"<Ω|Ψ> - top of (R⊗R)Ψ⊥ (rel.)\", topRes}, {\"time (s)\", tK}}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
