  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 6. The remaining contamination: is it structural?\nFor each state, use the top-killed basis $d_j$. Record the contamination ratios $K_j/S_{\\rm ref}$ and signal ratios $S_j/S_{\\rm ref}$, with $S_{\\rm ref}$ the signal of the last shape, which is nonzero on every HW state. If these ratios do not depend on the twist directions $\\varphi,\\omega$ (and converge in $\\varepsilon$), the contamination is structural, and the condition for a clean combination $v\\cdot d$ is the linear constraint $v\\cdot k=0$ with known coefficients. Three direction pairs are used, at $\\varepsilon=10^{-4}$ and $10^{-5}$.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "dirs = {{\"φ, ω\", φ, ω}, {\"φ', ω\", {-2/5, 3/8, 7/11}, ω}, {\"φ, ω'\", φ, {1/9, 5/4, -3/7}}};\n(* top-killed contamination and signal of each d_j, divided by the signal of the last shape *)\nratios[μ_, copy_, ε_, φv_, ωv_] := With[{d = KS[μ, copy, ε, φv, ωv]}, With[{tk = Table[topKill[j, d], {j, Length[locShapes]}]}, With[{sref = Last[tk] . d[\"S\"]}, {(# . d[\"K\"])/sref & /@ tk, (# . d[\"S\"])/sref & /@ tk}]]];\ndeepList = Select[hwList, #[[1]] [[1]] <= 4 &];\n{tR, ratTab} = AbsoluteTiming[Flatten[Table[With[{r = ratios[μc[[1]], μc[[2]], ε, dd[[2]], dd[[3]]]}, {μc[[1]], μc[[2]], dd[[1]], ε, N[r[[1]], 6], N[r[[2]], 6]}], {μc, deepList}, {dd, dirs}, {ε, {10^-4, 10^-5}}], 2]];\nGrid[Join[{{\"μ\", \"copy\", \"directions\", \"ε\", \"K_j/S_ref  (j = \" <> ToString[locShapes] <> \")\", \"S_j/S_ref\"}}, ratTab, {{\"time (s)\", tR}}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"942214\" data-output-id=\"59\" data-out-n=\"643\" data-sub-idx=\"5\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"13\" data-sub-start=\"5\" data-sub-end=\"5\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[643]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"26\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:38.74em;vertical-align:-19.1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:19.64em;\"><span style=\"top:-21.6em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:21.6em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:38.7em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-19.1em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:19.6em;\"><span style=\"top:-21.76em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-20.55em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose 