  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### 8b. Clean combinations per weight sector, and their rank\nThe weight $\\mu$ of $\\Psi$ is known, since the twist is diagonal, so a combination may depend on $\\mu$. In each HW sector, stack the leading contamination vectors $k_B$ of all HW-limit states $B$ of that weight (at $\\varepsilon=10^{-5}$). The **clean space** is their null space: the combinations $v\\cdot d$ whose contamination vanishes at leading order for every copy. The tolerance is $10^{-3}$ relative, against $O(\\varepsilon)$ noise. Then:\n- $\\kappa$ of each clean basis vector on each copy, at $\\varepsilon=10^{-4}$ (it should be $\\to1$, or \"CG = 0\");\n- the rank of the clean covectors restricted to $\\mathrm{HW}_\\mu$ over five $w$, with relative singular values at $\\varepsilon=10^{-4}$ and $10^{-5}$. Full rank (= multiplicity) means the CG states of that weight are fixed by clean data.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "cleanSpace[μ_] := Module[{rows = Table[normKS[KS2m[μ, c, 10^-5]][[1]], {c, Length[hwB[μ]]}], sv, r, V},\n   sv = SingularValueList[rows, Tolerance -> 0]; r = Count[sv, x_ /; x > 10^-3 Max[sv]];\n   V = SingularValueDecomposition[rows][[3]]; {Take[sv/Max[sv], UpTo[5]], Transpose[V][[r + 1 ;;]]}];\nκd[v_, d_] := With[{s = v . d[\"S\"], q = v . (d[\"S\"] + d[\"K\"])}, Which[Abs[q] < 10^-50 d[\"sc\"], \"0 = 0\", Abs[s] < 10^-50 d[\"sc\"], \"CG = 0\", True, N[q/s, 5]]];\nhwRank2[μ_, vs_, ε_] := Module[{zv = N[Exp[ε φ], pr], m}, m = Flatten[Table[With[{ds = dCovs[zv, N[Exp[ε ωv], pr]]}, Table[hwB[μ] . (v . ds), {v, vs}]], {ωv, ωSet}], 1];\n   N[SingularValueList[m, Tolerance -> 0]/Norm[m], 3]];\n{t8b, sec8} = AbsoluteTiming[Table[With[{cs = cleanSpace[μ], mult = Length[hwB[μ]]},\n     {μ, mult, Length[cs[[2]]], N[cs[[1]], 3],\n      Table[κd[v, KS2m[μ, c, 10^-4]], {c, mult}, {v, cs[[2]]}],\n      If[cs[[2]] === {}, \"-\", {Take[hwRank2[μ, cs[[2]], 10^-4], UpTo[mult + 1]], Take[hwRank2[μ, cs[[2]], 10^-5], UpTo[mult + 1]]}]}], {μ, Rest[hwSecs]}]];\nGrid[Join[{{\"μ\", \"mult\", \"dim clean space\", \"singular values of the constraints (rel.)\", \"κ of clean basis vectors per copy (ε=10^-4)\", \"HW-restricted singular values {ε=10^-4, 10^-5}\"}}, sec8, {{\"time (s)\", t8b, \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\"}}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
