      {
       "data": "Out[667]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|c|c|c|c|}\\hline\\mu  & \\text{mult} & \\text{dim clean space} & \\text{singular values of the constraints (rel.)} & \\text{$\\kappa$ of clean basis vectors per copy ($\\varepsilon$=10\\^{}-4)} & \\text{HW-restricted singular values \\{$\\varepsilon$=10\\^{}-4, 10\\^{}-5\\}}\\\\\\hline\\left\\{6,1,1\\right\\} & 1 & 4 & \\left\\{1.\\,\\right\\} & \\begin{pmatrix}\\text{0 = 0} & 1.00000 & 1.00000 & 1.0000\\end{pmatrix} & \\begin{pmatrix}1.\\,\\\\1.\\,\\end{pmatrix}\\\\\\hline\\left\\{5,3,0\\right\\} & 1 & 4 & \\left\\{1.\\,\\right\\} & \\begin{pmatrix}1.0000 & 1.00000 & \\text{0 = 0} & 1.00000\\end{pmatrix} & \\begin{pmatrix}1.\\,\\\\1.\\,\\end{pmatrix}\\\\\\hline\\left\\{5,2,1\\right\\} & 2 & 3 & \\left\\{1.\\,,0.0346\\right\\} & \\begin{pmatrix}1.0000 & 1.0000 & 1.0000\\\\1.00000 & 1.00000 & 1.0000\\end{pmatrix} & \\begin{pmatrix}1.\\, & 0.155\\\\1.\\, & 0.155\\end{pmatrix}\\\\\\hline\\left\\{4,4,0\\right\\} & 1 & 4 & \\left\\{1.\\,\\right\\} & \\begin{pmatrix}1.0000 & 1.1885 & \\text{0 = 0} & 1.0001\\end{pmatrix} & \\begin{pmatrix}1.\\,\\\\1.\\,\\end{pmatrix}\\\\\\hline\\left\\{4,3,1\\right\\} & 2 & 3 & \\left\\{1.\\,,0.282\\right\\} & \\begin{pmatrix}1.0001 & 1.0000 & 1.0000\\\\1.0000 & 1.00000 & 0.99997\\end{pmatrix} & \\begin{pmatrix}1.\\, & 0.0541\\\\1.\\, & 0.0541\\end{pmatrix… [latex truncated: 1594 chars total]",
