  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### 8c. End to end: the HW CG states from clean Q-side numbers\nFor each HW-limit state $B$ of weight $\\mu$, the data are the Q-side numbers only. Each is a transfer eigenvalue times $\\langle\\Omega|\\Psi_B\\rangle$, minus its top part:\n$$q_X=\\Big(X^B/f_X-(c_X\\cdot e_1e_1)\\Big)\\langle\\Omega|\\Psi_B\\rangle,\\qquad X\\in\\{T_{(1,1)},T_{(2,2)},T_{(3,2)}\\ \\text{at}\\ \\theta_1-3h;\\ A;\\ B\\},$$\nwith $f_X=1$ for the site-2 insertions. Combine them with the clean vectors of the sector, at five values of $w$. The model is $q_v(w)=\\big(v\\cdot d(w)\\big)\\big|_{\\rm HW_\\mu}\\cdot a$, and least squares gives $a$, the coordinates of $P_{\\rm HW}\\Psi_B$ in `hwB[μ]`. The table compares $a$ with the true $\\texttt{hwB}[\\mu]\\cdot\\Psi_B$ (direction **and** scale, with $\\langle x_0|\\Psi\\rangle=1$). Both the relative error and the angle error should be $O(\\varepsilon)$. The eigenvalues $X^B$ are read off from $X\\Psi_B$, which stands in for the Q's here.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* Q-side numbers of the five top-killed insertions for state Ψ at twists (zv, wv) *)\nqNums[Ψ_, zv_, wv_] := Module[{Z = DiagonalMatrix[zv], k = Ordering[Abs[Ψ], -1][[1]], ΩΨ = Om2[zv, wv] . Ψ, ev, RRi = With[{g = RrotInv[zv, wv]}, KroneckerProduct[g, g]], e11 = kron[e1, e1]},\n   ev[X_] := (X . Ψ)[[k]]/Ψ[[k]];\n   Join[Table[(ev[TL2[λ, uLoc, Z]]/fOf[λ] - cλ[λ, zv, wv] . e11) ΩΨ, {λ, locShapes}], Table[(ev[X] - ((Om2[zv, wv] . X) . RRi) . e11) ΩΨ, {X, site2Ops[zv]}]]];\nreconHW[μ_, copy_, ε_] := Module[{zv = N[Exp[ε φ], pr], Ψ, vs = cleanSpace[μ][[2]], M, y, a, tru},\n   Ψ = pickState[μ, copy, zv][\"psi\"];\n   {M, y} = Transpose[Flatten[Table[With[{wv = N[Exp[ε ωv], pr]}, With[{ds = dCovs[zv, wv], q = qNums[Ψ, zv, wv]}, Table[{hwB[μ] . (v . ds), v . q}, {v, vs}]]], {ωv, ωSet}], 1]];\n   a = LeastSquares[M, y]; tru = hwB[μ] . Ψ;\n   {N[Norm[a - tru]/Norm[tru], 3], N[Sqrt[Max[0, 1 - Abs[Conjugate[a] . tru]^2/(Norm[a]^2 Norm[tru]^2)]], 3]}];\n{t8c, rec8} = AbsoluteTiming[Table[Join[{μc[[1]], μc[[2]], Length[hwB[μc[[1]]]]}, reconHW[μc[[1]], μc[[2]], 10^-4], reconHW[μc[[1]], μc[[2]], 10^-5]], {μc, nonTop}]];\nGrid[Join[{{\"μ\", \"copy\", \"mult\", \"rel. error of a, ε=10^-4\", \"angle error, ε=10^-4\", \"rel. error, ε=10^-5\", \"angle error, ε=10^-5\"}}, rec8, {{\"time (s)\", t8c, \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\"}}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
