  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "**Result of the scan (finite test twist, P1, 120 digits, 126 shape/shift pairs).**\n- **Nontrivial site-1 local:** exactly three, $T_{(1,1)}$, $T_{(2,2)}$, $T_{(3,2)}$, all at $c=-3$.\n- **Not local at any $c=-6..2$:** $T_{(1)}$, $T_{(2)}$, $T_{(2,1)}$, $T_{(3)}$, $T_{(3,1)}$.\n- **Vanish identically on $\\langle\\Omega|$** (zero covector) at $c=-3$, and at a few other shifts: $T_{(3,3)}$ and every shape with $\\lambda_1=4$.\n- **No hits of the other kinds:** no shape is site-2 local or an eigen-covector at these shifts.\n\nThis agrees with the earlier machine-precision scan in `L2-310-localization-EH.wb`.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
